{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-cd-integration","title":"CI/CD 中的迁移集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/operations/ci-cd-integration","wordCount":1106,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-cd-中的迁移集成\">CI/CD 中的迁移集成</h1><p>将数据库迁移纳入 CI/CD 流水线是「把 schema 当代码管理」的工程闭环。手动在生产环境跑 SQL 的时代已经过去——现代团队要求每一条迁移文件都经过自动化校验、在类生产环境预演、通过审批门禁后才能触达生产数据库。这不仅是效率问题，更是安全问题：一条未经验证的 DDL 可以让整个服务瘫痪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>迁移的 CI/CD 集成需要解决三个层次的问题：静态校验（文件本身是否正确）、动态验证（在真实数据库上是否能安全执行）、发布门禁（何时何地由谁触发执行）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[开发者提交迁移文件] --&gt; B[PR 触发 CI]&#10;    B --&gt; C{静态校验}&#10;    C --&gt;|通过| D{动态验证}&#10;    C --&gt;|失败| E[阻断合并]&#10;    D --&gt;|通过| F[PR Approved + Merged]&#10;    D --&gt;|失败| E&#10;    F --&gt; G[CD: Staging 自动执行]&#10;    G --&gt; H{Staging 验证}&#10;    H --&gt;|通过| I[生产发布门禁]&#10;    H --&gt;|失败| J[回滚 Staging + 告警]&#10;    I --&gt;|审批| K[生产执行 + 监控]&#10;    I --&gt;|拒绝| L[等待修复]\">graph TD\n    A[开发者提交迁移文件] --&gt; B[PR 触发 CI]\n    B --&gt; C{静态校验}\n    C --&gt;|通过| D{动态验证}\n    C --&gt;|失败| E[阻断合并]\n    D --&gt;|通过| F[PR Approved + Merged]\n    D --&gt;|失败| E\n    F --&gt; G[CD: Staging 自动执行]\n    G --&gt; H{Staging 验证}\n    H --&gt;|通过| I[生产发布门禁]\n    H --&gt;|失败| J[回滚 Staging + 告警]\n    I --&gt;|审批| K[生产执行 + 监控]\n    I --&gt;|拒绝| L[等待修复]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CI/CD 阶段</th>\n<th>校验内容</th>\n<th>工具示例</th>\n<th>阻断级别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PR 静态检查</td>\n<td>SQL 语法、命名规范、checksum</td>\n<td>sqlfluff, squawk, flyway validate</td>\n<td>阻断合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PR 兼容性检查</td>\n<td>是否有破坏性变更</td>\n<td>atlas lint, skeema diff</td>\n<td>阻断合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PR 时间预估</td>\n<td>ALTER 在大表上的预估耗时</td>\n<td>gh-ost --test-on-replica</td>\n<td>标记需人工审批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Staging 执行</td>\n<td>在类生产数据上实际执行</td>\n<td>flyway migrate (staging)</td>\n<td>阻断生产发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产前门禁</td>\n<td>人工审批 + 自动检查</td>\n<td>Spinnaker, ArgoCD</td>\n<td>阻断执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产执行</td>\n<td>实际迁移 + 实时监控</td>\n<td>flyway migrate + PagerDuty</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产后验证</td>\n<td>schema 一致性确认</td>\n<td>atlas schema diff</td>\n<td>告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"静态校验层-在-pr-中拦截问题\">静态校验层：在 PR 中拦截问题</h2><p><strong>SQL Linting（语法与风格）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/migration-lint.yml&#10;name: Migration Lint&#10;on: pull_request&#10;jobs:&#10;  lint:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - name: Lint SQL migrations&#10;        run: |&#10;          sqlfluff lint db/migrations/ --dialect postgres&#10;      - name: Check Flyway naming&#10;        run: |&#10;          flyway validate -locations=filesystem:db/migrations/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/migration-lint.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Migration Lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pull_request</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  lint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Lint SQL migrations</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          sqlfluff lint db/migrations/ --dialect postgres</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Check Flyway naming</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          flyway validate -locations=filesystem:db/migrations/</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>破坏性变更检测</strong>：</p>\n<p>工具如 Atlas Lint 和 squawk 可以检测以下高风险模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>DROP TABLE</code> / <code>DROP COLUMN</code>——数据不可恢复</li>\n<li><code>ALTER COLUMN SET NOT NULL</code>——可能有 NULL 数据导致失败</li>\n<li><code>ALTER COLUMN TYPE</code>——隐式 table rewrite，大表锁表</li>\n<li>直接 <code>CREATE INDEX</code>（而非 <code>CONCURRENTLY</code>）——阻塞写入</li>\n<li>在同一迁移中混合 DDL 和 DML</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# squawk (PostgreSQL 专用 linter)&#10;squawk db/migrations/V020__change_column_type.sql&#10;&#10;# 输出：&#10;# V020__change_column_type.sql:3&#10;# WARNING: changing-column-type&#10;#   Changing the type of a column requires an ACCESS EXCLUSIVE lock&#10;#   and rewrites the table. Consider using expand-contract pattern.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># squawk (PostgreSQL 专用 linter)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">squawk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> db/migrations/V020__change_column_type.sql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># V020__change_column_type.sql:3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># WARNING: changing-column-type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   Changing the type of a column requires an ACCESS EXCLUSIVE lock</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   and rewrites the table. Consider using expand-contract pattern.</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>向后兼容性验证</strong>：</p>\n<p>核心规则：<strong>新迁移生效后，N-1 版本的应用代码必须仍能正常工作</strong>。这保证了滚动部署期间新旧版本并存的安全性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# CI 脚本：模拟 N-1 兼容性&#10;# 1. 应用所有迁移到测试库&#10;# 2. 用 N-1 版本的应用代码连接测试库&#10;# 3. 执行 N-1 的冒烟测试&#10;# 4. 如果测试失败 → 迁移不向后兼容，阻断 PR\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CI 脚本：模拟 N-1 兼容性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 应用所有迁移到测试库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 用 N-1 版本的应用代码连接测试库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 执行 N-1 的冒烟测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4. 如果测试失败 → 迁移不向后兼容，阻断 PR</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"动态验证层-在真实数据上预演\">动态验证层：在真实数据上预演</h2><p>静态检查无法发现所有问题——例如「这条 ALTER 在 50 亿行表上需要 4 小时」这类信息只有在类生产数据上才能获得。</p>\n<p><strong>方案一：生产数据克隆 + 执行计时</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 每周自动从生产备份创建 staging 数据库&#10;# CI 在 staging 上实际执行迁移并计时&#10;flyway migrate -url=jdbc:postgresql://staging-db/myapp&#10;&#10;# 记录执行时间&#10;# 如果超过阈值（如 30s），标记需要在线变更工具\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每周自动从生产备份创建 staging 数据库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CI 在 staging 上实际执行迁移并计时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flyway</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> migrate</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -url=jdbc:postgresql://staging-db/myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 记录执行时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 如果超过阈值（如 30s），标记需要在线变更工具</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>方案二：gh-ost test-on-replica</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 在 replica 上测试 gh-ost 操作（不实际切换）&#10;gh-ost \\&#10;  --host=replica-db \\&#10;  --database=myapp \\&#10;  --table=orders \\&#10;  --alter=&quot;ADD COLUMN note TEXT&quot; \\&#10;  --test-on-replica \\&#10;  --verbose&#10;# 输出预估时间、磁盘空间需求、chunk 策略\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 replica 上测试 gh-ost 操作（不实际切换）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh-ost</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --host=replica-db</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --database=myapp</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --table=orders</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --alter=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ADD COLUMN note TEXT\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --test-on-replica</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --verbose</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出预估时间、磁盘空间需求、chunk 策略</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>方案三：Schema 对比验证</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 迁移执行后，验证实际 schema 与期望一致&#10;atlas schema diff \\&#10;  --from &quot;mysql://staging-db/myapp&quot; \\&#10;  --to &quot;file://db/schema.hcl&quot;&#10;# 任何差异都说明迁移文件不完整或有手动变更\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 迁移执行后，验证实际 schema 与期望一致</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">atlas</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> schema</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"mysql://staging-db/myapp\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --to</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"file://db/schema.hcl\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 任何差异都说明迁移文件不完整或有手动变更</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"发布门禁与审批流程\">发布门禁与审批流程</h2><p>不同风险等级的迁移应该有不同的审批要求：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[迁移文件分类] --&gt; B{风险评估}&#10;    B --&gt;|低风险| C[自动执行]&#10;    B --&gt;|中风险| D[需要一人审批]&#10;    B --&gt;|高风险| E[需要 DBA + 值班审批]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;ADD COLUMN nullable&lt;br/&gt;ADD INDEX CONCURRENTLY&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;ADD NOT NULL + DEFAULT&lt;br/&gt;DROP COLUMN(已确认无引用)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;ALTER COLUMN TYPE&lt;br/&gt;DROP TABLE&lt;br/&gt;大表任何变更&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[迁移文件分类] --&gt; B{风险评估}\n    B --&gt;|低风险| C[自动执行]\n    B --&gt;|中风险| D[需要一人审批]\n    B --&gt;|高风险| E[需要 DBA + 值班审批]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[\"ADD COLUMN nullable&lt;br/&gt;ADD INDEX CONCURRENTLY\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"ADD NOT NULL + DEFAULT&lt;br/&gt;DROP COLUMN(已确认无引用)\"]\n    E --&gt; E1[\"ALTER COLUMN TYPE&lt;br/&gt;DROP TABLE&lt;br/&gt;大表任何变更\"]</pre><p><strong>风险分级标准</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>低风险</strong>：Instant DDL（加 nullable 列）、CONCURRENTLY 索引、仅影响新写入的约束</li>\n<li><strong>中风险</strong>：需要全表扫描但可在线（VALIDATE CONSTRAINT、中型表索引）</li>\n<li><strong>高风险</strong>：需要 table rewrite、影响外键、涉及数据转换、表 &gt; 10 亿行</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实现方式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub CODEOWNERS 实现 DBA 审批&#10;# .github/CODEOWNERS&#10;db/migrations/*high_risk* @dba-team&#10;db/migrations/* @backend-team\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub CODEOWNERS 实现 DBA 审批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/CODEOWNERS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">db/migrations/*high_risk* @dba-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">db/migrations/* @backend-team</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"生产执行策略\">生产执行策略</h2><p><strong>策略一：应用启动时自动迁移</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Spring Boot + Flyway（适用于低风险、小表）&#10;// application.yml&#10;spring:&#10;  flyway:&#10;    enabled: true&#10;    baseline-on-migrate: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Spring Boot + Flyway（适用于低风险、小表）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// application.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">spring</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  flyway</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    enabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    baseline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">on</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">migrate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span></code></pre></div><p>优势：简单，部署即迁移。\n风险：Pod 并发启动时可能 race condition（Flyway 有表锁保护）；大迁移阻塞应用启动。</p>\n<p><strong>策略二：独立迁移步骤（推荐）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Kubernetes Job：先迁移，再部署应用&#10;apiVersion: batch/v1&#10;kind: Job&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: db-migrate&#10;spec:&#10;  template:&#10;    spec:&#10;      containers:&#10;        - name: migrate&#10;          image: flyway/flyway:latest&#10;          args: [&#39;migrate&#39;]&#10;          env:&#10;            - name: FLYWAY_URL&#10;              valueFrom:&#10;                secretKeyRef:&#10;                  name: db-credentials&#10;                  key: url\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Kubernetes Job：先迁移，再部署应用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Job</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">db-migrate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">migrate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">flyway/flyway:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'migrate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FLYWAY_URL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              valueFrom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                secretKeyRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">db-credentials</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">url</span></span></code></pre></div><p>优势：迁移与应用部署解耦；迁移失败不影响已有 Pod。\n最佳实践：迁移 Job 完成后、新版 Pod 启动前有验证步骤。</p>\n<p><strong>策略三：逐步灰度执行（大规模系统）</strong></p>\n<p>对于分片数据库，迁移按分片逐步执行：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>先在 1 个分片执行 → 监控 15 分钟</li>\n<li>再在 10% 分片执行 → 监控 1 小时</li>\n<li>全部分片执行</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"监控与告警\">监控与告警</h2><p>迁移执行期间的关键指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>迁移执行时间</strong>：超过预估时间的 2x → 告警</li>\n<li><strong>Replica lag</strong>：超过 2s → 暂停迁移（gh-ost 自动）</li>\n<li><strong>连接池使用率</strong>：超过 80% → 可能 MDL 阻塞了</li>\n<li><strong>错误率</strong>：应用报 schema 相关错误 → 可能兼容性问题</li>\n<li><strong>锁等待数</strong>：<code>pg_stat_activity</code> 中 <code>wait_event_type = &#39;Lock&#39;</code> 数量突增</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CI/CD 集成将迁移从「人工操作」变为「自动化流水线」，三层防护：静态 → 动态 → 门禁</li>\n<li>静态校验用 SQL linter + 破坏性变更检测在 PR 阶段拦截问题</li>\n<li>动态验证在类生产数据上实际预演，获取真实耗时和风险评估</li>\n<li>风险分级决定审批要求：低风险自动、高风险多人审批</li>\n<li>生产执行推荐独立 Job 而非应用启动时内联——迁移与部署解耦</li>\n<li>执行期间的监控是最后一道安全网</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../tooling/flyway-and-liquibase\">Flyway 与 Liquibase</a>：CI 中使用的版本化迁移工具详解</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../microservices-architecture/service-communication/sync-communication\">微服务中的服务通信</a>：微服务架构下多服务独立迁移的协调问题</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CI/CD 中的迁移集成","id":"ci-cd-中的迁移集成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"静态校验层：在 PR 中拦截问题","id":"静态校验层-在-pr-中拦截问题"},{"level":2,"text":"动态验证层：在真实数据上预演","id":"动态验证层-在真实数据上预演"},{"level":2,"text":"发布门禁与审批流程","id":"发布门禁与审批流程"},{"level":2,"text":"生产执行策略","id":"生产执行策略"},{"level":2,"text":"监控与告警","id":"监控与告警"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"PostgreSQL 迁移工具生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/tooling/postgres-migration-tools"},"next":{"title":"回滚策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/operations/rollback-strategies"}}